SUMMARY:OLD HOME 2026 + FRIENDS
DESCRIPTION:OLD HOME 2026 + FRIENDS Old Home wake up. Never die. A night of
  raw guitars\, brooding melodies and fearless songwriting\, OLD HOME 2026 
 + FRIENDS brings together four artists pushing alternative music in their 
 own direction. Headlining the night is Old Home\, blending the urgency of 
 post-punk with spoken-word intensity. Imagine the restless energy of Fugaz
 i colliding with the haunting atmosphere of The Cure - powerful\, poetic a
 nd impossible to ignore. Joining them are Local Authority\, delivering shi
 mmering shoegaze and dream-pop textures that drift between lush soundscape
 s and driving rhythms\, sitting somewhere between The Cure and Slowdive. J
 ack Dylan and the Villains bring an alt-country rock 'n' roll edge\, fusin
 g gritty storytelling with expansive guitar work that fans of Dire Straits
  and The Drones will appreciate. Opening the evening is Connor Mitchell\, 
 whose stripped-back songwriting draws from the dark Australian grit of The
  Drones and the timeless folk spirit of Townes Van Zandt. If you love post
 -punk\, shoegaze\, alternative rock\, dream pop or alt-country\, this is a
  lineup built for discovering your next favourite band. Come early for hap
 py hour\, stay late and experience four unique artists sharing one unforge
 ttable night at The Presynct. 📅 Friday 11th September ⏰ Doors 6:00pm 
 (Happy Hour) | Event Doors from 7:00pm 🎟 General $20+BF | Door $25 🔞
  18+ Event 🩴 NO Thongs Permitted 🚱 NO Outside Drink bottles
